# Preventive hardening: local environment files are workstation state and must
# not be included in a Vercel upload. This reduces local configuration leakage
# and contamination risk; it is not evidence about the September 8 incident.
#
# Reference: docs/development/deployment-runtime-contract.md

.env.local
.env.development.local
.env.test.local
.env.production.local
.env.development
